From 9b72aa9ba3c797d789d3a41569936b2db715e261 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EberhartLeberhart <eberhartleberhart585@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:47:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] redmi_a5: Root nur lesend einhaengen, fsck beim Start (ro
 fsck.repair=yes)

- Befehlszeile hatte "rw": / war sofort beschreibbar, systemd-fsck-root wurde
  uebersprungen (ConditionPathIsReadWrite=!/) -> nie ein fsck
- jetzt "ro fsck.repair=yes": systemd prueft und repariert vor dem
  Umschalten auf rw durch /etc/fstab
- Beleg 07.11.: zweites Redmi ro -> e2fsck clean -> rw; Arbeitshandy hatte
  "clean with errors" (Inode 8101 /var/log/wtmp), danach clean, 0 failed

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01W8YQkFAqgbw689knydrHtG
---
 arch/arm64/configs/redmi_a5_defconfig | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/redmi_a5_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/redmi_a5_defconfig
index ec2f318de..66afae9d5 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/redmi_a5_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/redmi_a5_defconfig
@@ -40,7 +40,7 @@ CONFIG_NUMA=y
 CONFIG_XEN=y
 CONFIG_COMPAT=y
 CONFIG_RANDOMIZE_BASE=y
-CONFIG_CMDLINE="console=tty0 loglevel=8 ignore_loglevel clk_ignore_unused pd_ignore_unused panic=5 nokaslr kvm-arm.mode=none id_aa64mmfr1.vh=0 root=PARTLABEL=userdata rootwait rw fbcon=logo-count:1 fbcon=logo-pos:center"
+CONFIG_CMDLINE="console=tty0 loglevel=8 ignore_loglevel clk_ignore_unused pd_ignore_unused panic=5 nokaslr kvm-arm.mode=none id_aa64mmfr1.vh=0 root=PARTLABEL=userdata rootwait ro fsck.repair=yes fbcon=logo-count:1 fbcon=logo-pos:center"
 CONFIG_CMDLINE_FORCE=y
 CONFIG_HIBERNATION=y
 CONFIG_WQ_POWER_EFFICIENT_DEFAULT=y
-- 
2.43.0

